Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: Extract ALL images from pages for Grid View

- Added extractAllImages() function to extract all img tags from HTML
- Modified crawlAndParseUrl() to download and store multiple images
- Creates multiple assets with type LINK_BANNER_IMAGE
- Filters out small images, tracking pixels, and data URIs
- Limits to 10 images maximum per page
- First image stored for backward compatibility
- Remaining images stored as additional assets for Grid View
